  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Terminal velocity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">η</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence terminal velocity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>'</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math></p>",
